            <description><![CDATA[<h2>App Inspector 0.2.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>App Inspector now keeps itself up to date. It checks for a new version once a day, downloads it in the background and installs it when you quit the app.</li>
<li>Turn automatic checks or installs off in Settings, or choose Check for Updates… in the app menu.</li>
<li>Every update is signed, and App Inspector refuses one whose signature doesn’t match.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
